  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School supplies for children in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main duty for all kids is to study. Children of Nepal face a number of challenges on the way to getting educated because of different socio-economic reasons. Walking long distances to reach the school holding books in hands - it&apos;s their everyday reality. FOH will help kids from rural Ramechhap area of Nepal with uniforms, sneakers, school bags and main school supplies.  These children are enlightened leaders of tomorrow, let&apos;s help them together.</narrative>
  </description>
